    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "3.2",
      "title": "Visor Requirements",
      "body": "● Visor must be made of metal grill or plates, concealed under chainmail.\n● Chainmail must be properly attached to the visor with metal, leather or fabric thread.\n● Visor must not be too long or too short and respect the proportions of historical sources.\n● Nasal helmet visor bottom line must end between nose and chin.\n● The fixation system must be reproduced as per historical sources (“spoon” or “cross”).\n● It is allowed to add a metal plate to protect the throat. Such a plate must be strong enough to endure full contact fight and must be concealed under the aventail.",
      "page_from": 6,
      "page_to": 6,
      "stable_key": "nasals-and-breteches:3.2",
      "parent_key": "nasals-and-breteches:3",
