    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "3.4",
      "title": "Aventail",
      "body": "● Nasal and breteche helmets must be worn with chainmail aventails. Fabric or scales aventails are not allowed.\n● Aventails must conform to the Aventails document.\n● Aventails must be attached to the bascinet by a suspension system made of vervelles and leather.\n● The aventail must be fastened down to the edge of a padded pelerine attached to the helmet liner.\n● Protective plates covering the cervical spine must be hidden under the aventail.",
